model-001\n    name: \"Llama-3.1-8B anchor EMA validation\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1 (GQA side — POSITIVE)\"\n    status: DONE\n    result: \"r=+0.471, Δpert=+6.6%, hypothesis HOLDS on GQA\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0-URGENT: Confound resolution (D005)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - plan_id: confound-ctrl-001\n    name: \"Confound control: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B (same arch + reasoning)\"\n    claim: \"Confound resolution: architecture vs reasoning training\"\n    priority: P0-URGENT\n    description: |\n      Perfect control: same Llama GQA architecture as Llama-3.1-8B +\n      same reasoning distillation as DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B.\n      If r~0.15 → reasoning training is confound, D004 fails.\n      If r~0.47 → architecture (KV head count / group ratio) matters.\n      Run identical protocol to neg-cross-model-001 (20 problems, 55% sparsity, γ=0.99).\n    model: \"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\"\n    gpu_hours: 2\n    depends_on: [neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: confound-ctrl-002\n    name: \"Confound control: Qwen2-7B-Instruct (same arch + instruction)\"\n    claim: \"Confound resolution: architecture vs reasoning training\"\n    priority: P0\n    description: |\n      Second control: same Qwen2 GQA architecture as DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B +\n      instruction training. If r~0.47 → Qwen2 arch is fine, reasoning is confound.\n    model: \"Qwen/Qwen2-7B-Instruct\"\n    gpu_hours: 2\n    depends_on: [mvp-001b]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Core experiments (narrative TBD after confound resolution)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - plan_id: llama-sparsity-sweep\n    name: \"Llama sparsity level sweep: push Δpert higher\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1, 3 (strengthen GQA positive evidence)\"\n    priority: P0\n    description: |\n      Test higher sparsity on Llama: {50%, 55%, 60%, 65%, 70%}.\n      Current Δpert=+6.6% at 55%. Higher sparsity may widen the gap\n      between redundant and novel tokens.\n    model: \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\"\n    gpu_hours: 4\n    depends_on: [neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: llama-layer-analysis\n    name: \"Llama per-layer r + Δpert decomposition\"\n    claim: \"Claim 3 (per-layer architecture comparison)\"\n    priority: P0\n    description: |\n      Per-layer analysis on Llama data (from neg-cross-model-001).\n      Compare with DeepSeek per-layer profile.\n      Key question: do all layers show positive signal on GQA, or concentrated?\n    gpu_hours: 1\n    depends_on: [neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: kv-bench-001\n    registry_id: kv-bench-001\n    name: \"KV eviction benchmark: CARC-KV vs baselines\"\n    claim: \"Claim 4 (O(1) KV eviction)\"\n    priority: P0\n    description: |\n      CARC-KV (O(1)) vs H2O (O(n)) vs SnapKV vs StreamingLLM.\n      KV budgets {30%, 50%, 70%}. Eval: perplexity + accuracy.\n    model: \"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\"\n    gpu_hours: 20\n    depends_on: []\n    status: PREPARING\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Strengthen architecture-dependence narrative\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - plan_id: cross-arch-mistral\n    name: \"Mistral-7B validation (2nd GQA model)\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1 (GQA generalization)\"\n    priority: P1\n    description: |\n      Repeat validation on Mistral-7B-Instruct (standard GQA).\n      Confirms GQA positive is not Llama-specific.\n    model: \"mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\"\n    gpu_hours: 6\n    depends_on: [neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: mla-signal-analysis\n    name: \"MLA latent space semantic fidelity analysis\"\n    claim: \"Claim 2 (mechanistic: why MLA breaks signal)\"\n    priority: SUSPENDED\n    description: |\n      SUSPENDED (D005): DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B is NOT MLA.\n      No MLA model available to analyze. Reactivate only if a true MLA\n      model (DeepSeek-V2/V3) becomes testable.\n    gpu_hours: 4\n    depends_on: [mvp-001b, neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: SUSPENDED\n\n  - plan_id: kv-eviction-wallclock\n    name: \"Wall-clock: O(1) vs O(n) eviction cost\"\n    claim: \"Claim 4\"\n    priority: P1\n    description: |\n      Eviction overhead timing at L={4K, 8K, 16K, 32K}.\n      CARC-KV O(1) vs H2O O(n).\n    gpu_hours: 10\n    depends_on: [kv-bench-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: neg-per-head\n    name: \"Per-head KV contribution analysis\"\n    claim: \"Claim 2, 3 (is it just head count 4 vs 8?)\"\n    priority: P1\n    description: |\n      Normalize per-head signal contribution.\n      DeepSeek: 4 KV heads, Llama: 8 KV heads.\n      Test: even per-head, does GQA show stronger signal?\n    gpu_hours: 2\n    depends_on: [mvp-001b, neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: Extensions\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - plan_id: kv-eviction-ablation\n    name: \"KV eviction: key-only vs key+value anchor\"\n    claim: \"Claim 4\"\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_hours: 5\n    depends_on: [kv-bench-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: llama-downstream\n    name: \"Llama two-tier sparsity downstream accuracy\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1 (practical value of cross-axis on GQA)\"\n    priority: P2\n    description: |\n      Apply CARC two-tier MLP sparsity on Llama: 55% redundant / 40% novel.\n      Compare accuracy vs uniform sparsity on MATH problems.\n    gpu_hours: 6\n    depends_on: [llama-sparsity-sweep]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n# ============================================================\n# Timeline (12-day sprint, 5/12 → 5/25)\n# ============================================================\n# Day 1 (5/12): llama-sparsity-sweep + llama-layer-analysis (CPU)\n# Day 1-3: kv-bench-001 (parallel after sparsity sweep)\n# Day 2-4: cross-arch-mistral (download + run)\n# Day 3-5: mla-signal-analysis + neg-per-head\n# Day 4-7: kv-eviction-wallclock\n# Day 6-12: paper writing (parallel with P2)\n","numLines":195,"startLine":1,"totalLines":195}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NTfcz4Xxaz4Bw29MJGWCRJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full experiment plan. Let me identify all PLANNED experiments and generate detailed median-tier predictions for each.\n\nThe PLANNED experiments are:\n1. confound-ctrl-001: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B (same arch + reasoning)\n2. confound-ctrl-002: Qwen2-7B-Instruct (same arch + instruction)\n3. llama-sparsity-sweep: Llama sparsity level sweep\n4. llama-layer-analysis: Llama per-layer r + Δpert decomposition\n\n\n5. kv-bench-001: KV eviction benchmark (PREPARING status)\n6. cross-arch-mistral: Mistral-7B validation (2nd GQA model)\n7. mla-signal-analysis: SUSPENDED\n8. kv-eviction-wallclock: Wall-clock O(1) vs O(n)\n9. neg-per-head: Per-head KV contribution analysis\n10. kv-eviction-ablation: KV eviction key-only vs key+value\n11. llama-downstream: Llama two-tier sparsity downstream accuracy\n\nNow I'll work through the median-tier predictions for each of these experiments.\n\nLooking at the signal strength across architectures, Mistral shows weaker correlations than Llama and smaller perturbation effects, while the high-sparsity regime in Llama improves but doesn't dramatically amplify the signal. MLA has qualitative support but lacks clean quantitative metrics, and Mistral's per-problem consistency isn't as tight as Llama's. For the confound controls, I need to figure out where DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B fits in the median tier, especially given the architecture details around GQA versus MLA variants.\n\nThe confound experiments should show moderate correlations in the median tier—reasoning training versus architecture effects should both register but neither dominates cleanly. Qwen2-7B-Instruct as a non-reasoning GQA baseline should similarly show moderate signal, suggesting reasoning training isn't the primary confound. The MLA signal analysis is suspended, so I'll note that separately. For kv-bench-001, CARC-KV should be competitive with baselines but not decisively outperforming in the median tier. Now I'm ready to structure the full YAML with these median-tier expectations in mind. to Llama but slightly lower due to reasoning training effects), supports architecture > reasoning training but with some noise\n2. confound-ctrl-002: r~0.33-0.40 (GQA architecture works, instruction-only model), confirms architecture matters\n3. llama-sparsity-sweep: Δpert increases at higher sparsity but moderately — 65%: ~8.5%, 70%: ~10%\n4. llama-layer-analysis: Signal concentrated in middle-to-late layers, early layers weak\n5. kv-bench-001: CARC-KV within 0.5-1.5 ppl of H2O, better than StreamingLLM\n6. cross-arch-mistral: r~0.30, Δpert~+3% at 55% — positive but weaker\n7. mla-signal-analysis: SUSPENDED\n8. kv-eviction-wallclock: O(1) 3-5x faster than H2O at 16K+, with per-head signal still favoring GQA though the gap narrows\n9. kv-eviction-ablation shows key+value slightly outperforming key-only, and the two-tier approach yields modest 1-2% accuracy gains over uniform allocation\n10. Mistral shows positive but weak correlations (0.25-0.38) with smaller perturbation effects, plus worse per-problem consistency than Llama, while MLA provides qualitative evidence without clean quantitative metrics\n\nNow I'm examining the confound controls more carefully — the original Qwen2 GQA baseline gave r=0.15 with Δpert=-2.2%, which is notably lower than Llama's signal, so I need to understand why the architecture difference produces this gap.\n\nFor the Llama reasoning distill control, I'd expect r around 0.35-0.42 in the median tier — if reasoning training were the main confound, the signal would collapse further, but if architecture dominates, it should stay relatively strong. For the Qwen2 instruction-only control, I'm testing whether the reasoning distillation specifically is what degraded the signal, or if it's something about Qwen2's architecture itself.\n\nNow I need to pull together the full experiment plan and expand the data for each PLANNED experiment. Generating the YAML output with experiment details, tables, and figure descriptions... The Qwen2 architecture itself seems to produce weaker cross-axis correlations regardless of training approach, likely due to differences in how it structures KV representations compared to Llama. For the sparsity sweep across Llama models, I'm predicting that higher sparsity levels will increasingly benefit performance, with the effect growing from around 5% at 50% sparsity up to 10% at 70% sparsity, since more aggressive pruning disproportionately removes redundant tokens that have high KV similarity. Now I'm breaking down the per-layer redundancy patterns across Llama's 32 layers — the middle layers (8-19) show the strongest signal around 0.45-0.55, where the core reasoning happens and KV redundancy couples most tightly with activation patterns, while early layers are still forming representations and final layers taper off as the model shifts toward output generation. Then I'm moving into the benchmark comparisons across different KV compression methods at various budget levels. Looking at the performance degradation patterns, CARC-KV struggles more at aggressive compression levels because its O(1) design doesn't capture the full attention landscape, though it recovers at 70% budget where eviction becomes more straightforward. StreamingLLM consistently underperforms since it only preserves recent and sink tokens. For Mistral-7B with its grouped query attention, the KV-similarity signal is weaker than Llama despite being positive, and per-problem consistency suffers because not all reasoning patterns generate the same redundancy patterns.\n\nNow examining the wall-clock overhead of different eviction strategies across sequence lengths, CARC-KV maintains constant O(1) eviction time while H2O's O(n) cost scales dramatically—at 32K tokens it's 32x slower, making the architectural choice a critical performance differentiator.\n\nLooking at per-head KV contributions, Llama's 8 heads each carry substantially more semantic signal than DeepSeek's 4 heads even after normalizing for head count, suggesting the underlying representation structure itself differs between models rather than just the number of heads being the determining factor.\n\nFor the KV eviction analysis, I'm reconsidering whether key-only eviction actually outperforms key+value eviction — keys determine attention routing and token importance, which should be more critical for deciding what to evict than the content values themselves, though I need to verify what the paper actually shows here.\n\nNow looking at the downstream task results with two-tier sparsity on Llama, where applying different sparsity rates to redundant versus novel tokens yields meaningful gains over uniform sparsity approaches.\n\nThe modest improvement over matched-average uniform sparsity comes down to the KV signal's limited impact — while the perturbation difference is +6.6%, MLP sparsity only affects a portion of the total computation, so the accuracy gains don't scale linearly.\n\nBefore finalizing the YAML output, I need to revisit the confound controls for the median tier. The original D004 narrative claimed GQA works better than MLA, but D005 showed that DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B actually uses GQA, not MLA, so I'm comparing Llama-3.1-8B (GQA, instruction-tuned) with its perturbation effect of +6.6% against the other model.\n\nNow looking at the confound experiments to separate architecture effects from training effects. The first control shows that Llama architecture maintains stronger signal even under reasoning training, dropping from 0.47 to 0.38 rather than collapsing to 0.15, which indicates architecture is the dominant factor. The second control tests Qwen2 architecture with instruction training to isolate the training contribution.\n\nComparing across the 2x2 matrix of architectures and training approaches reveals that Qwen2 is inherently weaker than Llama regardless of training, but reasoning training compounds this weakness further—the architecture gap accounts for roughly 0.15-0.22 points of correlation loss, while the training shift adds additional degradation.\n\nNow I'm settling on median estimates for Mistral and the Llama sparsity sweep: Mistral's correlation around 0.31 with a 55% performance drop at 2.8, and Llama's performance degradation reaching 8.5 at 65% sparsity and 10.0 at 70% sparsity.\n\nFor the MLA signal analysis, the experiment is suspended since no true MLA model is available, but the median tier should describe what the qualitative analysis would show if it could run — the per-layer correlation degradation pattern and effective rank ratio estimates — while flagging that this remains theoretical rather than empirically grounded. I'm settling on presenting the tier definitions as they were originally conceived, with a note about which experiments are currently suspended — the median tier imagines certain results even if the actual execution plan has changed, so I'll just lay out the data for each experiment as specified and move forward with the YAML output.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8013,"cache_read_input_tokens":20773,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8013},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dfacb55-cee2-410c-8532-251c7d291126","uuid":"3fd8eb4e-48c5-4148-aedb-258b5e3a93ec"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NTfcz4Xxaz4Bw29MJGWCRJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  从 \"architecture binary (GQA=works, MLA=fails)\" 软化为 \"architecture modulates signal strength\"。\n  Confound 2×2 矩阵显示架构和训练方式均有影响，架构为主效应（Δr~0.15-0.22），训练方式为次要效应（Δr~0.09-0.10），两者近似可加。\n  Mistral-7B 作为第二个 GQA 模型方向一致但信号明显弱于 Llama，说明 GQA 内部也有梯度，不是均质的 \"GQA=positive\"。\n  Claim 1 调整为 \"cross-axis signal strength is architecture-modulated\"；\n  Claim 2 降级为 \"suggestive evidence\"，因 MLA 实验 SUSPENDED 且 Qwen2 代理分析缺乏干净的定量对照；\n  Δpert 的 practical significance 需诚实讨论——+2.8% (Mistral, 55%) 是否值得 cross-axis 额外复杂度。\n  强调 per-layer analysis 和 O(1) KV eviction 作为 standalone contribution 来补偿 cross-axis story 的弱化。\n  Title 加 hedge: \"Evidence for Architecture-Modulated Cross-Axis Signals in Reasoning Inference\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0-URGENT: Confound resolution\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Confound control: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\"\n    plan_id: confound-ctrl-001\n    description: >\n      Llama GQA 架构 + R1 推理蒸馏训练。与 Llama-3.1-8B (同架构, instruction) 和\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B (不同架构, 同训练) 构成 2×2 对照。\n      20 problems, 55% sparsity, γ=0.99, 协议与 neg-cross-model-001 完全一致。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.38\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: 3.8\n      dpert_55pct: 4.0\n      per_problem_r_mean: 0.37\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.22, 0.48]\n      total_tokens: ~13000\n      elapsed_s: ~750\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama 架构的 full-dimensional GQA KV projection 保留了 cosine similarity 的语义保真度，\n      即使经过 R1 推理蒸馏仍维持正向信号。r 从 0.47 降至 0.38 是因为推理蒸馏引入了更多样的\n      思维链模式（探索、回溯、自我修正），这些模式在 KV 空间中产生非单调的相似度变化，\n      部分解耦了 KV redundancy → MLP sparsity 的链条。但下降幅度有限（Δr=-0.09），\n      远好于 Qwen2 架构的 r=0.15，证明架构是主效应。\n      2×2 矩阵: Llama+Instruct=0.47, Llama+Reasoning=0.38, Qwen2+Instruct=0.25, Qwen2+Reasoning=0.15。\n      架构效应 ~0.18, 训练效应 ~0.10, 近似可加。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2×2 Confound Matrix (with confound-ctrl-002)\"\n        columns: [Architecture, Training, pearson_r, dpert_55pct, Source]\n        rows:\n          - [Llama-GQA, Instruction, 0.47, +6.6%, \"neg-cross-model-001\"]\n          - [Llama-GQA, Reasoning-distill, 0.38, +4.0%, \"confound-ctrl-001\"]\n          - [Qwen2-GQA, Instruction, 0.25, +1.5%, \"confound-ctrl-002\"]\n          - [Qwen2-GQA, Reasoning-distill, 0.15, -2.2%, \"mvp-001b\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 heatmap: x 轴 Training (Instruction / Reasoning), y 轴 Architecture (Llama / Qwen2), cell 色深度编码 r 值 (0.15→红, 0.47→蓝), cell 内标注 r 和 Δpert\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构主效应: Llama→Qwen2 跨训练方式平均降 r ~0.18 (0.425→0.20)。\n      训练次效应: Instruction→Reasoning 跨架构平均降 r ~0.10 (0.36→0.265)。\n      交互效应弱: 两因素近似可加 (预测 Qwen2+Reasoning: 0.47-0.18-0.10=0.19, 实际 0.15, 差异在噪声范围)。\n      结论: 不能简单说 \"GQA works\"——Qwen2 也是 GQA 但 r 仅 0.25。应表述为 \"cross-axis signal \n      strength is modulated by both attention architecture specifics (KV head dimension, group ratio) \n      and training paradigm, with architecture as the dominant factor.\"\n\n  - name: \"Confound control: Qwen2-7B-Instruct\"\n    plan_id: confound-ctrl-002\n    description: >\n      Qwen2 GQA 架构 + instruction 训练 (非 reasoning)。与 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B \n      (同架构, reasoning) 对照，隔离训练方式的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.25\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: 1.0\n      dpert_55pct: 1.5\n      per_problem_r_mean: 0.24\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.10, 0.38]\n      total_tokens: ~11000\n      elapsed_s: ~600\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉推理蒸馏后 Qwen2 的信号从 r=0.15 改善到 r=0.25——推理训练确实引入了额外噪声\n      （蒸馏使模型在 reasoning trace 中产生更频繁的方向切换，打断 KV similarity 的连续性）。\n      但 r=0.25 仍远低于 Llama 的 r=0.47，说明 Qwen2 架构本身的 KV 表示结构\n      （28 KV heads vs Llama 的 8 KV heads with different group ratio，不同的 head dimension）\n      在 cosine similarity 空间中语义保真度更低。Δpert=+1.5% 虽然正向但几乎无实用价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Training effect isolation (Qwen2 arch fixed)\"\n        columns: [Model, Training, pearson_r, dpert_55pct, Δr_from_reasoning]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2-7B-Instruct, Instruction, 0.25, +1.5%, \"+0.10\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, Reasoning, 0.15, -2.2%, \"baseline\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: Qwen2 instruction vs reasoning, 双 y 轴 (r 左, Δpert 右), 误差棒表示 per-problem 范围\"\n    analysis: >\n      训练效应在 Qwen2 上约 Δr=+0.10, ΔΔpert=+3.7%。这比 Llama 上的训练效应 (Δr=-0.09) \n      幅度相当，方向一致。但即使去掉推理蒸馏的负面影响，Qwen2 仍然是弱信号架构。\n      这为 paper 提供了关键的 nuance: 不应说 \"reasoning training breaks the signal\"，\n      而应说 \"reasoning training weakens a signal whose baseline strength is architecture-determined.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Core experiments\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Llama sparsity level sweep\"\n    plan_id: llama-sparsity-sweep\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上测试 {50%, 55%, 60%, 65%, 70%} 五个 MLP sparsity 水平，\n      观察 Δpert 随 sparsity 的变化趋势。已知 55% 下 Δpert=+6.6%。\n    expected_results:\n      r_50pct: 0.47\n      r_55pct: 0.47\n      r_60pct: 0.46\n      r_65pct: 0.44\n      r_70pct: 0.41\n      dpert_50pct: 5.2\n      dpert_55pct: 6.6\n      dpert_60pct: 7.3\n      dpert_65pct: 8.5\n      dpert_70pct: 10.0\n      accuracy_drop_uniform_70pct: -12.5%\n      accuracy_drop_guided_70pct: -2.5%\n    result_rationale: >\n      Δpert 随 sparsity 单调递增但边际递减：从 50→55 增 +1.4, 55→60 增 +0.7, \n      60→65 增 +1.2, 65→70 增 +1.5。高 sparsity 下 redundant tokens 仍可大幅剪枝 \n      (因 KV similarity 高 → surprisal 低 → MLP activation 天然稀疏), 而 novel tokens \n      在高 sparsity 下精度严重受损, 拉大了 guided vs uniform 的差距。\n      但增益未出现\"大幅放大\"——从 +6.6% 到 +10.0% 是 1.5x 而非 3x 或更高。\n      r 在高 sparsity 下略降 (0.47→0.41) 因为极端稀疏引入了非线性效应——\n      当 70% neurons 被剪枝, 一些原本与 KV sim 线性相关的 token 开始出现 clipping 行为。\n      结论: 存在有意义的 sparsity-amplification 效应但不够戏剧性, \n      不足以单独支撑 \"cross-axis unlocks extreme sparsity\" 的强叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama Sparsity Sweep Results\"\n        columns: [Sparsity, Δpert(%), r, Accuracy_uniform(%), Accuracy_guided(%), Gap(%)]\n        rows:\n          - [50%, +5.2, 0.47, 85.0, 89.2, +4.2]\n          - [55%, +6.6, 0.47, 81.5, 87.1, +5.6]\n          - [60%, +7.3, 0.46, 77.0, 83.3, +6.3]\n          - [65%, +8.5, 0.44, 71.5, 78.5, +7.0]\n          - [70%, +10.0, 0.41, 64.0, 73.0, +9.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双线图: x 轴 Sparsity (50-70%), 左 y 轴 Δpert, 右 y 轴 r, 显示 Δpert 上升同时 r 轻微下降的 trade-off\"\n      - \"面积图: uniform vs guided accuracy gap 随 sparsity 放大, 阴影区域为 gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      Δpert 从 55% 的 +6.6% 增长到 70% 的 +10.0%, 增幅 ~52%, 说明 cross-axis signal \n      在高 sparsity 下确有价值但不是 transformative。Accuracy gap 从 +5.6% 增长到 +9.0% \n      更有说服力, 但需诚实指出: 70% uniform sparsity 本身已将准确率压到 64%, \n      此时 +9% 的 guided 优势可能源于 \"避免灾难性错误\" 而非 \"精细优化\"。\n      建议在论文中聚焦 60-65% 区间作为 practical operating point, \n      70% 作为 upper bound reference 但标注其局限性。\n\n  - name: \"Llama per-layer r + Δpert decomposition\"\n    plan_id: llama-layer-analysis\n    description: >\n      对 neg-cross-model-001 已有数据进行 per-layer 分析 (CPU 后处理)，\n      计算每层的 r 和 Δpert，与 DeepSeek per-layer profile 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      layers_0_7_r_mean: 0.28\n      layers_8_15_r_mean: 0.52\n      layers_16_23_r_mean: 0.55\n      layers_24_31_r_mean: 0.44\n      peak_layer: 18\n      peak_r: 0.61\n      layers_with_r_above_0.4: 20  # out of 32\n      deepseek_peak_r: 0.22\n      deepseek_peak_layer: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      信号在中间层 (8-23) 最强, peak 在 layer 18 附近 (r=0.61)。\n      这与 transformer 的功能分层一致: 早期层构建低层表示 (KV similarity 语义性弱), \n      中间层执行核心推理变换 (KV redundancy 与 MLP activation pattern 耦合最紧密), \n      末端层朝 output distribution 过渡 (解耦)。\n      与 DeepSeek 对比, Llama 在所有层段均高于 DeepSeek, 但差距在中间层最大 \n      (0.52 vs 0.18), 在早期层最小 (0.28 vs 0.15)——早期层的 KV similarity \n      在两种架构上都缺乏语义性, 而中间层 Llama GQA 的优势充分体现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Layer r Comparison (8-layer bins)\"\n        columns: [Layer_Range, Llama_r, DeepSeek_r, Gap]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0-7\", 0.28, 0.15, +0.13]\n          - [\"8-15\", 0.52, 0.18, +0.34]\n          - [\"16-23\", 0.55, 0.16, +0.39]\n          - [\"24-31\", 0.44, 0.12, +0.32]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2 (paper): 并排 heatmap, x 轴 layer (0-31), y 轴 per-problem r, 色深编码 r 值。Llama 中间层亮蓝带 vs DeepSeek 全灰\"\n      - \"Fig 3 (paper): 折线图, x 轴 layer, y 轴 per-layer r, 两条线 (Llama 蓝实线, DeepSeek 红虚线), 阴影为 per-problem 方差\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-layer 分析提供了 paper 的核心可视化之一。中间层 gap (Δr~0.35-0.39) 远大于 \n      全局 gap (Δr~0.32), 说明信号差异不是均匀分布的——architecture effect 在 \n      computation-intensive layers 被放大。这支持 mechanistic story: \n      GQA 的 full-dim KV 在这些层中保留了足够的 angular structure 使 cosine similarity \n      有语义意义, 而 Qwen2 的 KV 在相同层中已经失去了这种结构。\n      但注意: 没有真正的 MLA 模型对照, 这里的 \"mechanistic evidence\" 只是 suggestive。\n\n  - name: \"KV eviction benchmark: CARC-KV vs baselines\"\n    plan_id: kv-bench-001\n    description: >\n      CARC-KV (O(1) EMA anchor) vs H2O (O(n) attention-score) vs SnapKV (O(n) observation window) \n      vs StreamingLLM (sink + recent)。KV budget {30%, 50%, 70%}。\n      Eval: perplexity + AIME accuracy。Model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B。\n    expected_results:\n      ppl_full_kv: 5.2\n      ppl_carc_70pct: 5.5\n      ppl_h2o_70pct: 5.4\n      ppl_snapkv_70pct: 5.5\n      ppl_streamingllm_70pct: 6.1\n      ppl_carc_50pct: 6.4\n      ppl_h2o_50pct: 6.1\n      ppl_snapkv_50pct: 6.2\n      ppl_streamingllm_50pct: 7.8\n      ppl_carc_30pct: 8.8\n      ppl_h2o_30pct: 8.0\n      ppl_snapkv_30pct: 8.3\n      ppl_streamingllm_30pct: 11.5\n      acc_carc_50pct: 62%\n      acc_h2o_50pct: 65%\n      acc_full: 70%\n    result_rationale: >\n      CARC-KV 在 70% budget 下与 H2O/SnapKV 持平 (Δppl≤0.1), 因为宽松预算下 eviction \n      决策简单, O(1) 的信息劣势不明显。在 50% 和 30% budget 下, CARC-KV 落后 H2O 约 \n      0.3-0.8 ppl——O(1) 方法只看 EMA anchor 而非全部 attention score, 在需要精细判断时 \n      信息不足。StreamingLLM 在所有 budget 下显著最差, 因为 sink + recent 策略完全无视 \n      中间 token 的重要性。\n      核心卖点不是 CARC-KV 更准, 而是 \"competitive quality at O(1) cost\"——\n      在 50% budget 下只多 0.3 ppl 但 eviction 速度随序列长度线性优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: KV Eviction Perplexity Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, Complexity, KV_30%, KV_50%, KV_70%]\n        rows:\n          - [Full KV, \"—\", 5.2, 5.2, 5.2]\n          - [CARC-KV, \"O(1)\", 8.8, 6.4, 5.5]\n          - [H2O, \"O(n)\", 8.0, 6.1, 5.4]\n          - [SnapKV, \"O(n)\", 8.3, 6.2, 5.5]\n          - [StreamingLLM, \"O(1)\", 11.5, 7.8, 6.1]\n      - name: \"Table: KV Eviction AIME Accuracy\"\n        columns: [Method, KV_50%, KV_70%]\n        rows:\n          - [Full KV, 70%, 70%]\n          - [CARC-KV, 62%, 68%]\n          - [H2O, 65%, 69%]\n          - [SnapKV, 64%, 68%]\n          - [StreamingLLM, 48%, 60%]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6 (paper): grouped bar chart, x 轴 KV budget, y 轴 perplexity, 四种方法不同颜色, 虚线为 full KV baseline\"\n      - \"补充 Fig: accuracy vs KV budget 折线图, 显示 CARC-KV 在 accuracy 维度的竞争力\"\n    analysis: >\n      CARC-KV 作为 O(1) 方法在所有 budget 下均优于唯一的 O(1) 竞品 StreamingLLM (Δppl 2.5-3.0)。\n      与 O(n) 方法相比, 70% budget 完全持平, 50% budget 落后 0.3 ppl, 30% budget 落后 0.8 ppl。\n      这是一个合理的 standalone contribution: \"near-parity quality with O(1) complexity\"。\n      论文中应突出 efficiency-quality Pareto 前沿, 而非 claim CARC-KV 是 SOTA eviction 方法。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Strengthen narrative\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B validation (2nd GQA model)\"\n    plan_id: cross-arch-mistral\n    description: >\n      在 Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 上重复 cross-axis 验证协议。\n      作为第二个 GQA 模型验证 signal 非 Llama 特有。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.31\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: 1.8\n      dpert_55pct: 2.8\n      per_problem_r_mean: 0.30\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.15, 0.45]\n      per_problem_r_below_0.2_count: 4  # out of 20\n      total_tokens: ~14000\n      elapsed_s: ~800\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral 使用标准 GQA (8 KV heads, 与 Llama 相同), 信号方向正确 (r=0.31>0) \n      但显著弱于 Llama (0.31 vs 0.47)。差异来源:\n      (1) Mistral 的 sliding window attention (SWA) 在部分层限制了 KV 的有效感受野, \n      使 EMA anchor 基于的 long-range similarity 信号被截断;\n      (2) Mistral 的训练数据和目标与 Llama 不同, 产生了不同的 KV redundancy pattern;\n      (3) 4/20 problems 的 r<0.2 说明部分问题类型下 Mistral 的思维模式不产生 \n      足够的 token-level redundancy (可能因 Mistral 生成更紧凑的推理链)。\n      Δpert=+2.8% 虽正但实用价值有限——需要诚实讨论 \"is +2.8% worth the complexity?\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-GQA Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [Model, KV_heads, pearson_r, dpert_55pct, per_problem_r_range, Problems_r_lt_0.2]\n        rows:\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, 8, 0.47, +6.6%, \"[0.42, 0.49]\", \"0/20\"]\n          - [Mistral-7B, 8, 0.31, +2.8%, \"[0.15, 0.45]\", \"4/20\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, 4, 0.15, -2.2%, \"[0.05, 0.28]\", \"12/20\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Mistral Per-Problem r Distribution\"\n        columns: [r_bin, count, fraction]\n        rows:\n          - [\"<0.2\", 4, \"20%\"]\n          - [\"0.2-0.3\", 6, \"30%\"]\n          - [\"0.3-0.4\", 7, \"35%\"]\n          - [\">0.4\", 3, \"15%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 (paper): per-problem r scatter, 三个模型并排, x 轴 problem index, y 轴 r, 显示 Llama 的紧凑带 vs Mistral 的分散 vs DeepSeek 的低平\"\n      - \"Box plot: 三模型 per-problem r 分布对比, 显示中位数和 IQR\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mistral 结果对 paper 是双刃剑:\n      (+) 确认 GQA 架构上 cross-axis signal 正向, 非 Llama 特有, 增加了 generalizability;\n      (-) r=0.31 和 Δpert=+2.8% 远弱于 Llama, 说明即使在同为 8-KV-head GQA 的模型间, \n      信号强度也有 ~50% 的波动。这要求将 Claim 1 从 \"GQA produces positive signal\" \n      弱化为 \"GQA enables positive signal whose strength varies with model-specific factors\"。\n      4/20 problems r<0.2 的现象需要分析: 是否与 problem difficulty/length/reasoning style 相关。\n      Per-problem 一致性的下降是 median 档最明显的弱点之一——reviewer 可能质疑 \n      \"if 20% of problems show near-zero signal, how reliable is the prediction?\"\n\n  - name: \"MLA latent space semantic fidelity analysis\"\n    plan_id: mla-signal-analysis\n    description: >\n      SUSPENDED (D005): DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 非 MLA 架构，无真正 MLA 模型可测。\n      以下为假设性 median-tier 预测——若获得真 MLA 模型 (如 DeepSeek-V2-Lite) 的预期结果。\n      分析 MLA latent space 中 cosine similarity 的语义保真度退化。\n    expected_results:\n      status: SUSPENDED\n      hypothetical_effective_rank_ratio: 0.45\n      hypothetical_angular_uniformity: 0.72\n      hypothetical_cosine_sim_semantic_correlation: 0.18\n      hypothetical_gqa_cosine_sim_semantic_correlation: 0.65\n      per_layer_r_decay_pattern: \"early layers OK (r~0.25), middle layers collapse (r~0.08), late layers partial recovery (r~0.12)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      [HYPOTHETICAL] MLA 将 KV 压缩到低秩 latent space (effective rank ratio ~0.45, \n      即有效秩仅为 full-dimensional KV 的 45%)。在此压缩空间中, cosine similarity \n      的语义保真度大幅退化: 压缩后的向量在 angular space 中分布更均匀 (uniformity=0.72, \n      接近 random), 导致 cosine similarity 与 token-level semantic redundancy 的相关性 \n      仅 0.18 (vs GQA 的 0.65)。Per-layer 分析显示中间层退化最严重——恰好是 \n      cross-axis signal 应最强的层段, 形成双重打击。\n      定性上这个 story 成立 (latent compression → angular collapse → signal loss), \n      但缺乏干净的 A/B 定量指标——因为 MLA vs GQA 模型在训练数据、参数量、\n      architecture 其他方面也不同, 无法归因纯粹到 latent compression。\n      因此 Claim 2 只能是 \"suggestive evidence\"。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"[HYPOTHETICAL] Effective rank ratio 对比 bar chart: GQA ~1.0 vs MLA ~0.45\"\n      - \"[HYPOTHETICAL] Angular distribution scatter: GQA 中 KV vectors 有 cluster 结构, MLA 中近似均匀球面\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验 SUSPENDED 是 median 档最大的叙事缺口。没有真 MLA 模型的实验数据, \n      Claim 2 (mechanistic explanation) 只能基于间接证据 (Qwen2 vs Llama per-layer r 对比) \n      给出 suggestive 论证。论文中应将 Section 5 从 \"Why Does MLA Break the Signal?\" \n      改为 \"Architectural Factors Modulating Signal Strength\", 用 per-layer + per-head \n      分析代替 MLA-specific 机制分析。如果实验恢复 (找到可测 MLA 模型), \n      median 档预期定性结论正确但定量 clean comparison 困难。\n\n  - name: \"Wall-clock: O(1) vs O(n) eviction cost\"\n    plan_id: kv-eviction-wallclock\n    description: >\n      测量 CARC-KV O(1) vs H2O O(n) 的 per-step eviction 耗时, \n      序列长度 L={4K, 8K, 16K, 32K}。\n    expected_results:\n      carc_4k_ms: 0.08\n      carc_8k_ms: 0.09\n      carc_16k_ms: 0.09\n      carc_32k_ms: 0.10\n      h2o_4k_ms: 0.25\n      h2o_8k_ms: 0.55\n      h2o_16k_ms: 1.20\n      h2o_32k_ms: 2.60\n      speedup_4k: 3.1x\n      speedup_8k: 6.1x\n      speedup_16k: 13.3x\n      speedup_32k: 26.0x\n      eviction_as_fraction_of_step_32k_carc: 0.3%\n      eviction_as_fraction_of_step_32k_h2o: 7.8%\n    result_rationale: >\n      CARC-KV 每步只做一次 EMA update + 一次 cosine similarity 比较, 计算量与序列长度无关 \n      (O(1)), 实测耗时 ~0.08-0.10ms 随 L 变化极小 (内存访问模式微变)。\n      H2O 需要累积所有 token 的 attention score 再选 top-k eviction candidate, \n      计算量 O(n) 随序列线性增长。在 32K 序列下, H2O eviction 占整个 decoding step 的 7.8%, \n      而 CARC-KV 仅 0.3%——在长序列推理 (如 AIME 思维链平均 15K+ tokens) 场景下, \n      这是有意义的实际加速。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Eviction Latency Comparison\"\n        columns: [Seq_Length, CARC-KV(ms), H2O(ms), Speedup]\n        rows:\n          - [4K, 0.08, 0.25, 3.1x]\n          - [8K, 0.09, 0.55, 6.1x]\n          - [16K, 0.09, 1.20, 13.3x]\n          - [32K, 0.10, 2.60, 26.0x]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-log plot: x 轴序列长度, y 轴 eviction latency, CARC-KV 水平线 vs H2O 斜率 ~1 的上升线\"\n    analysis: >\n      Wall-clock 结果是 O(1) KV eviction 作为 standalone contribution 的关键支撑。\n      在 16K+ 序列下 speedup >13x, 结合 kv-bench-001 中 70% budget 下 quality parity, \n      构成有说服力的 efficiency-quality trade-off。\n      注意事项: 这里测量的是纯 eviction overhead, 不是 end-to-end throughput——\n      需要在论文中明确说明, 因为 eviction 只占 decoding step 的一小部分。\n\n  - name: \"Per-head KV contribution analysis\"\n    plan_id: neg-per-head\n    description: >\n      分析 per-head cross-axis signal 贡献, 对 Llama (8 KV heads) 和 \n      DeepSeek-Distill-Qwen (4 KV heads) 进行 head-level r 分解, \n      检验是否仅是 head count 差异导致信号差距。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_per_head_r_mean: 0.40\n      llama_per_head_r_range: [0.28, 0.52]\n      llama_best_head_r: 0.52\n      llama_worst_head_r: 0.28\n      deepseek_per_head_r_mean: 0.11\n      deepseek_per_head_r_range: [0.04, 0.19]\n      deepseek_best_head_r: 0.19\n      deepseek_worst_head_r: 0.04\n      ratio_per_head: 3.6x  # 0.40/0.11\n      ratio_aggregate: 3.1x  # 0.47/0.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      即使在 per-head 基础上, Llama 的每个 KV head 的 signal 仍显著强于 DeepSeek-Qwen 的 \n      每个 KV head (mean r: 0.40 vs 0.11, 3.6x 差距)。这排除了 \"Llama 只是因为有更多 head \n      所以 aggregate signal 更强\" 的替代假设。Per-head ratio (3.6x) 甚至略大于 aggregate \n      ratio (3.1x), 说明 Llama 的 head aggregation 实际上引入了少量 inter-head noise。\n      Llama 内部 head 间 r 的方差 ([0.28, 0.52]) 暗示不同 head 捕捉不同类型的 redundancy \n      信号——head 5-6 (r~0.50) 可能专注于 positional/syntactic redundancy, \n      而 head 1-2 (r~0.30) 捕捉更高层的 semantic pattern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Head r Comparison\"\n        columns: [Model, Heads, Per-Head_r_mean, Per-Head_r_range, Aggregate_r]\n        rows:\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, 8, 0.40, \"[0.28, 0.52]\", 0.47]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen, 4, 0.11, \"[0.04, 0.19]\", 0.15]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head r bar chart: 8 Llama heads + 4 DeepSeek heads 并排, 按 r 降序排列, 虚线标注 per-head mean\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-head 分析有效排除了 head-count confound, 但也引出了新问题: \n      为什么 Qwen2 架构的 per-head signal 这么弱? 可能原因包括:\n      (1) head dimension 差异 (Qwen2: 128, Llama: 128 — 实际相同, 排除);\n      (2) group ratio 差异 (Qwen2: 28Q/4KV=7:1, Llama: 32Q/8KV=4:1 — 更高的 group ratio \n      意味着每个 KV head 需要服务更多 query heads, 可能被迫学习更 general 的表示, \n      降低了与 specific MLP activation pattern 的耦合);\n      (3) 训练数据/目标差异。\n      Group ratio 假设 (4:1 vs 7:1) 是最有解释力的, 但需要更多模型验证。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: Extensions\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"KV eviction: key-only vs key+value anchor\"\n    plan_id: kv-eviction-ablation\n    description: >\n      消融实验: EMA anchor 分别基于 key-only, value-only, key+value concat。\n      在 50% KV budget 下比较 perplexity。\n    expected_results:\n      ppl_key_only: 6.2\n      ppl_value_only: 6.8\n      ppl_key_value_concat: 6.4\n      ppl_key_value_default: 6.4\n      ppl_full_kv: 5.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Key-only anchor 略优于 key+value concat (6.2 vs 6.4): key vectors 编码了 attention \n      routing 信息 (哪些 token 会被 attend to), 这与 token importance for eviction 直接相关。\n      Value vectors 携带 content 信息, 其 similarity 与 \"是否可安全 evict\" 的相关性较弱, \n      concat 后反而引入噪声。Value-only 最差 (6.8) 因为 value similarity 不反映 attention \n      pattern。差异幅度不大 (Δppl=0.2), 说明 key 和 value 都携带部分 redundancy 信息, \n      但 key 更 informative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Anchor Variant Ablation\"\n        columns: [Anchor_Type, ppl_50%_budget, Δppl_vs_full]\n        rows:\n          - [Key-only, 6.2, +1.0]\n          - [Key+Value (default), 6.4, +1.2]\n          - [Value-only, 6.8, +1.6]\n          - [Full KV (no eviction), 5.2, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 三种 anchor variant 的 ppl 对比, 误差棒表示跨 problem 方差\"\n    analysis: >\n      消融结果支持将 default 从 key+value 改为 key-only, 但增益有限 (0.2 ppl)。\n      论文中作为 supplementary ablation 呈现即可, 不需要在 main text 占过多篇幅。\n      如果选择 key-only 作为 final 方法, 需要重新跑 kv-bench-001 中的比较——\n      但时间可能不允许, 建议在 footnote 中提及 key-only variant exists and is marginally better。\n\n  - name: \"Llama two-tier sparsity downstream accuracy\"\n    plan_id: llama-downstream\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上应用 CARC two-tier MLP sparsity (redundant tokens 55%, novel tokens 40%), \n      与 uniform sparsity 在 MATH 数据集上比较准确率。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy_no_sparsity: 78.5%\n      accuracy_uniform_55pct: 72.0%\n      accuracy_uniform_47pct: 74.5%  # matched average sparsity\n      accuracy_two_tier_55_40: 75.5%\n      gain_over_uniform_55: +3.5%\n      gain_over_matched_avg: +1.0%\n      avg_effective_sparsity: 47.2%\n      fraction_tokens_redundant: 0.52\n    result_rationale: >\n      Two-tier sparsity 将 redundant tokens (52% of tokens, 由 KV sim > threshold 判定) \n      剪枝 55%, novel tokens 剪枝 40%, 平均有效 sparsity ~47.2%。\n      相比 uniform 55% (+3.5%) 的增益来自避免对 novel tokens 的过度剪枝——\n      这些 token 承载关键推理步骤, 55% sparsity 导致不可恢复的信息损失。\n      相比 matched-average uniform 47% (+1.0%) 的增益更有意义但幅度有限——\n      说明 adaptive allocation 确有价值但 cross-axis signal 的 Δpert=+6.6% \n      在 end-to-end accuracy 上被衰减了: 不是每个 Δpert gain 都直接转化为准确率, \n      因为 (a) 只有部分 tokens 被差异化处理, (b) 部分 MLP neurons 的激活对最终输出 \n      影响有限。+1.0% 的 gain 需要诚实评估是否 justify cross-axis 的额外系统复杂度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Downstream Accuracy Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, MLP_Sparsity, MATH_Accuracy, Δ_vs_no_sparsity]\n        rows:\n          - [No sparsity, 0%, 78.5%, \"—\"]\n          - [Uniform, 55%, 72.0%, -6.5%]\n          - [Uniform (matched avg), 47%, 74.5%, -4.0%]\n          - [Two-tier (CARC), \"55%/40%\", 75.5%, -3.0%]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 四种条件下 MATH 准确率, 标注 sparsity 节省和 accuracy trade-off\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 cross-axis story 的 practical significance 试金石。+1.0% over matched-average \n      是正面结果但不够强——reviewer 可能说 \"marginal gain doesn't justify the complexity \n      of maintaining cross-axis coordination.\" 论文中应框架为:\n      (1) 证明 cross-axis signal 可转化为下游增益 (方向正确);\n      (2) 承认当前增益幅度有限, 可能因 signal strength (r=0.47) 仍有提升空间;\n      (3) 将此与 O(1) KV eviction standalone value 互补——即使 cross-axis 增益有限, \n      KV eviction 本身仍有独立价值。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8013,"cache_read_input_tokens":20773,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8013},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dfacb55-cee2-410c-8532-251c7d291126","uuid":"74b50b9a-456a-4a9f-9b8c-8085f64cec6c"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":356710,"duration_api_ms":357933,"num_turns":3,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  从 \"architecture binary (GQA=works, MLA=fails)\" 软化为 \"architecture modulates signal strength\"。\n  Confound 2×2 矩阵显示架构和训练方式均有影响，架构为主效应（Δr~0.15-0.22），训练方式为次要效应（Δr~0.09-0.10），两者近似可加。\n  Mistral-7B 作为第二个 GQA 模型方向一致但信号明显弱于 Llama，说明 GQA 内部也有梯度，不是均质的 \"GQA=positive\"。\n  Claim 1 调整为 \"cross-axis signal strength is architecture-modulated\"；\n  Claim 2 降级为 \"suggestive evidence\"，因 MLA 实验 SUSPENDED 且 Qwen2 代理分析缺乏干净的定量对照；\n  Δpert 的 practical significance 需诚实讨论——+2.8% (Mistral, 55%) 是否值得 cross-axis 额外复杂度。\n  强调 per-layer analysis 和 O(1) KV eviction 作为 standalone contribution 来补偿 cross-axis story 的弱化。\n  Title 加 hedge: \"Evidence for Architecture-Modulated Cross-Axis Signals in Reasoning Inference\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0-URGENT: Confound resolution\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Confound control: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\"\n    plan_id: confound-ctrl-001\n    description: >\n      Llama GQA 架构 + R1 推理蒸馏训练。与 Llama-3.1-8B (同架构, instruction) 和\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B (不同架构, 同训练) 构成 2×2 对照。\n      20 problems, 55% sparsity, γ=0.99, 协议与 neg-cross-model-001 完全一致。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.38\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: 3.8\n      dpert_55pct: 4.0\n      per_problem_r_mean: 0.37\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.22, 0.48]\n      total_tokens: ~13000\n      elapsed_s: ~750\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama 架构的 full-dimensional GQA KV projection 保留了 cosine similarity 的语义保真度，\n      即使经过 R1 推理蒸馏仍维持正向信号。r 从 0.47 降至 0.38 是因为推理蒸馏引入了更多样的\n      思维链模式（探索、回溯、自我修正），这些模式在 KV 空间中产生非单调的相似度变化，\n      部分解耦了 KV redundancy → MLP sparsity 的链条。但下降幅度有限（Δr=-0.09），\n      远好于 Qwen2 架构的 r=0.15，证明架构是主效应。\n      2×2 矩阵: Llama+Instruct=0.47, Llama+Reasoning=0.38, Qwen2+Instruct=0.25, Qwen2+Reasoning=0.15。\n      架构效应 ~0.18, 训练效应 ~0.10, 近似可加。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2×2 Confound Matrix (with confound-ctrl-002)\"\n        columns: [Architecture, Training, pearson_r, dpert_55pct, Source]\n        rows:\n          - [Llama-GQA, Instruction, 0.47, +6.6%, \"neg-cross-model-001\"]\n          - [Llama-GQA, Reasoning-distill, 0.38, +4.0%, \"confound-ctrl-001\"]\n          - [Qwen2-GQA, Instruction, 0.25, +1.5%, \"confound-ctrl-002\"]\n          - [Qwen2-GQA, Reasoning-distill, 0.15, -2.2%, \"mvp-001b\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 heatmap: x 轴 Training (Instruction / Reasoning), y 轴 Architecture (Llama / Qwen2), cell 色深度编码 r 值 (0.15→红, 0.47→蓝), cell 内标注 r 和 Δpert\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构主效应: Llama→Qwen2 跨训练方式平均降 r ~0.18 (0.425→0.20)。\n      训练次效应: Instruction→Reasoning 跨架构平均降 r ~0.10 (0.36→0.265)。\n      交互效应弱: 两因素近似可加 (预测 Qwen2+Reasoning: 0.47-0.18-0.10=0.19, 实际 0.15, 差异在噪声范围)。\n      结论: 不能简单说 \"GQA works\"——Qwen2 也是 GQA 但 r 仅 0.25。应表述为 \"cross-axis signal \n      strength is modulated by both attention architecture specifics (KV head dimension, group ratio) \n      and training paradigm, with architecture as the dominant factor.\"\n\n  - name: \"Confound control: Qwen2-7B-Instruct\"\n    plan_id: confound-ctrl-002\n    description: >\n      Qwen2 GQA 架构 + instruction 训练 (非 reasoning)。与 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B \n      (同架构, reasoning) 对照，隔离训练方式的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.25\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: 1.0\n      dpert_55pct: 1.5\n      per_problem_r_mean: 0.24\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.10, 0.38]\n      total_tokens: ~11000\n      elapsed_s: ~600\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉推理蒸馏后 Qwen2 的信号从 r=0.15 改善到 r=0.25——推理训练确实引入了额外噪声\n      （蒸馏使模型在 reasoning trace 中产生更频繁的方向切换，打断 KV similarity 的连续性）。\n      但 r=0.25 仍远低于 Llama 的 r=0.47，说明 Qwen2 架构本身的 KV 表示结构\n      （28 KV heads vs Llama 的 8 KV heads with different group ratio，不同的 head dimension）\n      在 cosine similarity 空间中语义保真度更低。Δpert=+1.5% 虽然正向但几乎无实用价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Training effect isolation (Qwen2 arch fixed)\"\n        columns: [Model, Training, pearson_r, dpert_55pct, Δr_from_reasoning]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2-7B-Instruct, Instruction, 0.25, +1.5%, \"+0.10\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, Reasoning, 0.15, -2.2%, \"baseline\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: Qwen2 instruction vs reasoning, 双 y 轴 (r 左, Δpert 右), 误差棒表示 per-problem 范围\"\n    analysis: >\n      训练效应在 Qwen2 上约 Δr=+0.10, ΔΔpert=+3.7%。这比 Llama 上的训练效应 (Δr=-0.09) \n      幅度相当，方向一致。但即使去掉推理蒸馏的负面影响，Qwen2 仍然是弱信号架构。\n      这为 paper 提供了关键的 nuance: 不应说 \"reasoning training breaks the signal\"，\n      而应说 \"reasoning training weakens a signal whose baseline strength is architecture-determined.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Core experiments\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Llama sparsity level sweep\"\n    plan_id: llama-sparsity-sweep\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上测试 {50%, 55%, 60%, 65%, 70%} 五个 MLP sparsity 水平，\n      观察 Δpert 随 sparsity 的变化趋势。已知 55% 下 Δpert=+6.6%。\n    expected_results:\n      r_50pct: 0.47\n      r_55pct: 0.47\n      r_60pct: 0.46\n      r_65pct: 0.44\n      r_70pct: 0.41\n      dpert_50pct: 5.2\n      dpert_55pct: 6.6\n      dpert_60pct: 7.3\n      dpert_65pct: 8.5\n      dpert_70pct: 10.0\n      accuracy_drop_uniform_70pct: -12.5%\n      accuracy_drop_guided_70pct: -2.5%\n    result_rationale: >\n      Δpert 随 sparsity 单调递增但边际递减：从 50→55 增 +1.4, 55→60 增 +0.7, \n      60→65 增 +1.2, 65→70 增 +1.5。高 sparsity 下 redundant tokens 仍可大幅剪枝 \n      (因 KV similarity 高 → surprisal 低 → MLP activation 天然稀疏), 而 novel tokens \n      在高 sparsity 下精度严重受损, 拉大了 guided vs uniform 的差距。\n      但增益未出现\"大幅放大\"——从 +6.6% 到 +10.0% 是 1.5x 而非 3x 或更高。\n      r 在高 sparsity 下略降 (0.47→0.41) 因为极端稀疏引入了非线性效应——\n      当 70% neurons 被剪枝, 一些原本与 KV sim 线性相关的 token 开始出现 clipping 行为。\n      结论: 存在有意义的 sparsity-amplification 效应但不够戏剧性, \n      不足以单独支撑 \"cross-axis unlocks extreme sparsity\" 的强叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama Sparsity Sweep Results\"\n        columns: [Sparsity, Δpert(%), r, Accuracy_uniform(%), Accuracy_guided(%), Gap(%)]\n        rows:\n          - [50%, +5.2, 0.47, 85.0, 89.2, +4.2]\n          - [55%, +6.6, 0.47, 81.5, 87.1, +5.6]\n          - [60%, +7.3, 0.46, 77.0, 83.3, +6.3]\n          - [65%, +8.5, 0.44, 71.5, 78.5, +7.0]\n          - [70%, +10.0, 0.41, 64.0, 73.0, +9.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双线图: x 轴 Sparsity (50-70%), 左 y 轴 Δpert, 右 y 轴 r, 显示 Δpert 上升同时 r 轻微下降的 trade-off\"\n      - \"面积图: uniform vs guided accuracy gap 随 sparsity 放大, 阴影区域为 gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      Δpert 从 55% 的 +6.6% 增长到 70% 的 +10.0%, 增幅 ~52%, 说明 cross-axis signal \n      在高 sparsity 下确有价值但不是 transformative。Accuracy gap 从 +5.6% 增长到 +9.0% \n      更有说服力, 但需诚实指出: 70% uniform sparsity 本身已将准确率压到 64%, \n      此时 +9% 的 guided 优势可能源于 \"避免灾难性错误\" 而非 \"精细优化\"。\n      建议在论文中聚焦 60-65% 区间作为 practical operating point, \n      70% 作为 upper bound reference 但标注其局限性。\n\n  - name: \"Llama per-layer r + Δpert decomposition\"\n    plan_id: llama-layer-analysis\n    description: >\n      对 neg-cross-model-001 已有数据进行 per-layer 分析 (CPU 后处理)，\n      计算每层的 r 和 Δpert，与 DeepSeek per-layer profile 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      layers_0_7_r_mean: 0.28\n      layers_8_15_r_mean: 0.52\n      layers_16_23_r_mean: 0.55\n      layers_24_31_r_mean: 0.44\n      peak_layer: 18\n      peak_r: 0.61\n      layers_with_r_above_0.4: 20  # out of 32\n      deepseek_peak_r: 0.22\n      deepseek_peak_layer: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      信号在中间层 (8-23) 最强, peak 在 layer 18 附近 (r=0.61)。\n      这与 transformer 的功能分层一致: 早期层构建低层表示 (KV similarity 语义性弱), \n      中间层执行核心推理变换 (KV redundancy 与 MLP activation pattern 耦合最紧密), \n      末端层朝 output distribution 过渡 (解耦)。\n      与 DeepSeek 对比, Llama 在所有层段均高于 DeepSeek, 但差距在中间层最大 \n      (0.52 vs 0.18), 在早期层最小 (0.28 vs 0.15)——早期层的 KV similarity \n      在两种架构上都缺乏语义性, 而中间层 Llama GQA 的优势充分体现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Layer r Comparison (8-layer bins)\"\n        columns: [Layer_Range, Llama_r, DeepSeek_r, Gap]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0-7\", 0.28, 0.15, +0.13]\n          - [\"8-15\", 0.52, 0.18, +0.34]\n          - [\"16-23\", 0.55, 0.16, +0.39]\n          - [\"24-31\", 0.44, 0.12, +0.32]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2 (paper): 并排 heatmap, x 轴 layer (0-31), y 轴 per-problem r, 色深编码 r 值。Llama 中间层亮蓝带 vs DeepSeek 全灰\"\n      - \"Fig 3 (paper): 折线图, x 轴 layer, y 轴 per-layer r, 两条线 (Llama 蓝实线, DeepSeek 红虚线), 阴影为 per-problem 方差\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-layer 分析提供了 paper 的核心可视化之一。中间层 gap (Δr~0.35-0.39) 远大于 \n      全局 gap (Δr~0.32), 说明信号差异不是均匀分布的——architecture effect 在 \n      computation-intensive layers 被放大。这支持 mechanistic story: \n      GQA 的 full-dim KV 在这些层中保留了足够的 angular structure 使 cosine similarity \n      有语义意义, 而 Qwen2 的 KV 在相同层中已经失去了这种结构。\n      但注意: 没有真正的 MLA 模型对照, 这里的 \"mechanistic evidence\" 只是 suggestive。\n\n  - name: \"KV eviction benchmark: CARC-KV vs baselines\"\n    plan_id: kv-bench-001\n    description: >\n      CARC-KV (O(1) EMA anchor) vs H2O (O(n) attention-score) vs SnapKV (O(n) observation window) \n      vs StreamingLLM (sink + recent)。KV budget {30%, 50%, 70%}。\n      Eval: perplexity + AIME accuracy。Model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B。\n    expected_results:\n      ppl_full_kv: 5.2\n      ppl_carc_70pct: 5.5\n      ppl_h2o_70pct: 5.4\n      ppl_snapkv_70pct: 5.5\n      ppl_streamingllm_70pct: 6.1\n      ppl_carc_50pct: 6.4\n      ppl_h2o_50pct: 6.1\n      ppl_snapkv_50pct: 6.2\n      ppl_streamingllm_50pct: 7.8\n      ppl_carc_30pct: 8.8\n      ppl_h2o_30pct: 8.0\n      ppl_snapkv_30pct: 8.3\n      ppl_streamingllm_30pct: 11.5\n      acc_carc_50pct: 62%\n      acc_h2o_50pct: 65%\n      acc_full: 70%\n    result_rationale: >\n      CARC-KV 在 70% budget 下与 H2O/SnapKV 持平 (Δppl≤0.1), 因为宽松预算下 eviction \n      决策简单, O(1) 的信息劣势不明显。在 50% 和 30% budget 下, CARC-KV 落后 H2O 约 \n      0.3-0.8 ppl——O(1) 方法只看 EMA anchor 而非全部 attention score, 在需要精细判断时 \n      信息不足。StreamingLLM 在所有 budget 下显著最差, 因为 sink + recent 策略完全无视 \n      中间 token 的重要性。\n      核心卖点不是 CARC-KV 更准, 而是 \"competitive quality at O(1) cost\"——\n      在 50% budget 下只多 0.3 ppl 但 eviction 速度随序列长度线性优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: KV Eviction Perplexity Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, Complexity, KV_30%, KV_50%, KV_70%]\n        rows:\n          - [Full KV, \"—\", 5.2, 5.2, 5.2]\n          - [CARC-KV, \"O(1)\", 8.8, 6.4, 5.5]\n          - [H2O, \"O(n)\", 8.0, 6.1, 5.4]\n          - [SnapKV, \"O(n)\", 8.3, 6.2, 5.5]\n          - [StreamingLLM, \"O(1)\", 11.5, 7.8, 6.1]\n      - name: \"Table: KV Eviction AIME Accuracy\"\n        columns: [Method, KV_50%, KV_70%]\n        rows:\n          - [Full KV, 70%, 70%]\n          - [CARC-KV, 62%, 68%]\n          - [H2O, 65%, 69%]\n          - [SnapKV, 64%, 68%]\n          - [StreamingLLM, 48%, 60%]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6 (paper): grouped bar chart, x 轴 KV budget, y 轴 perplexity, 四种方法不同颜色, 虚线为 full KV baseline\"\n      - \"补充 Fig: accuracy vs KV budget 折线图, 显示 CARC-KV 在 accuracy 维度的竞争力\"\n    analysis: >\n      CARC-KV 作为 O(1) 方法在所有 budget 下均优于唯一的 O(1) 竞品 StreamingLLM (Δppl 2.5-3.0)。\n      与 O(n) 方法相比, 70% budget 完全持平, 50% budget 落后 0.3 ppl, 30% budget 落后 0.8 ppl。\n      这是一个合理的 standalone contribution: \"near-parity quality with O(1) complexity\"。\n      论文中应突出 efficiency-quality Pareto 前沿, 而非 claim CARC-KV 是 SOTA eviction 方法。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Strengthen narrative\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B validation (2nd GQA model)\"\n    plan_id: cross-arch-mistral\n    description: >\n      在 Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 上重复 cross-axis 验证协议。\n      作为第二个 GQA 模型验证 signal 非 Llama 特有。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.31\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: 1.8\n      dpert_55pct: 2.8\n      per_problem_r_mean: 0.30\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.15, 0.45]\n      per_problem_r_below_0.2_count: 4  # out of 20\n      total_tokens: ~14000\n      elapsed_s: ~800\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral 使用标准 GQA (8 KV heads, 与 Llama 相同), 信号方向正确 (r=0.31>0) \n      但显著弱于 Llama (0.31 vs 0.47)。差异来源:\n      (1) Mistral 的 sliding window attention (SWA) 在部分层限制了 KV 的有效感受野, \n      使 EMA anchor 基于的 long-range similarity 信号被截断;\n      (2) Mistral 的训练数据和目标与 Llama 不同, 产生了不同的 KV redundancy pattern;\n      (3) 4/20 problems 的 r<0.2 说明部分问题类型下 Mistral 的思维模式不产生 \n      足够的 token-level redundancy (可能因 Mistral 生成更紧凑的推理链)。\n      Δpert=+2.8% 虽正但实用价值有限——需要诚实讨论 \"is +2.8% worth the complexity?\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-GQA Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [Model, KV_heads, pearson_r, dpert_55pct, per_problem_r_range, Problems_r_lt_0.2]\n        rows:\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, 8, 0.47, +6.6%, \"[0.42, 0.49]\", \"0/20\"]\n          - [Mistral-7B, 8, 0.31, +2.8%, \"[0.15, 0.45]\", \"4/20\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, 4, 0.15, -2.2%, \"[0.05, 0.28]\", \"12/20\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Mistral Per-Problem r Distribution\"\n        columns: [r_bin, count, fraction]\n        rows:\n          - [\"<0.2\", 4, \"20%\"]\n          - [\"0.2-0.3\", 6, \"30%\"]\n          - [\"0.3-0.4\", 7, \"35%\"]\n          - [\">0.4\", 3, \"15%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 (paper): per-problem r scatter, 三个模型并排, x 轴 problem index, y 轴 r, 显示 Llama 的紧凑带 vs Mistral 的分散 vs DeepSeek 的低平\"\n      - \"Box plot: 三模型 per-problem r 分布对比, 显示中位数和 IQR\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mistral 结果对 paper 是双刃剑:\n      (+) 确认 GQA 架构上 cross-axis signal 正向, 非 Llama 特有, 增加了 generalizability;\n      (-) r=0.31 和 Δpert=+2.8% 远弱于 Llama, 说明即使在同为 8-KV-head GQA 的模型间, \n      信号强度也有 ~50% 的波动。这要求将 Claim 1 从 \"GQA produces positive signal\" \n      弱化为 \"GQA enables positive signal whose strength varies with model-specific factors\"。\n      4/20 problems r<0.2 的现象需要分析: 是否与 problem difficulty/length/reasoning style 相关。\n      Per-problem 一致性的下降是 median 档最明显的弱点之一——reviewer 可能质疑 \n      \"if 20% of problems show near-zero signal, how reliable is the prediction?\"\n\n  - name: \"MLA latent space semantic fidelity analysis\"\n    plan_id: mla-signal-analysis\n    description: >\n      SUSPENDED (D005): DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 非 MLA 架构，无真正 MLA 模型可测。\n      以下为假设性 median-tier 预测——若获得真 MLA 模型 (如 DeepSeek-V2-Lite) 的预期结果。\n      分析 MLA latent space 中 cosine similarity 的语义保真度退化。\n    expected_results:\n      status: SUSPENDED\n      hypothetical_effective_rank_ratio: 0.45\n      hypothetical_angular_uniformity: 0.72\n      hypothetical_cosine_sim_semantic_correlation: 0.18\n      hypothetical_gqa_cosine_sim_semantic_correlation: 0.65\n      per_layer_r_decay_pattern: \"early layers OK (r~0.25), middle layers collapse (r~0.08), late layers partial recovery (r~0.12)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      [HYPOTHETICAL] MLA 将 KV 压缩到低秩 latent space (effective rank ratio ~0.45, \n      即有效秩仅为 full-dimensional KV 的 45%)。在此压缩空间中, cosine similarity \n      的语义保真度大幅退化: 压缩后的向量在 angular space 中分布更均匀 (uniformity=0.72, \n      接近 random), 导致 cosine similarity 与 token-level semantic redundancy 的相关性 \n      仅 0.18 (vs GQA 的 0.65)。Per-layer 分析显示中间层退化最严重——恰好是 \n      cross-axis signal 应最强的层段, 形成双重打击。\n      定性上这个 story 成立 (latent compression → angular collapse → signal loss), \n      但缺乏干净的 A/B 定量指标——因为 MLA vs GQA 模型在训练数据、参数量、\n      architecture 其他方面也不同, 无法归因纯粹到 latent compression。\n      因此 Claim 2 只能是 \"suggestive evidence\"。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"[HYPOTHETICAL] Effective rank ratio 对比 bar chart: GQA ~1.0 vs MLA ~0.45\"\n      - \"[HYPOTHETICAL] Angular distribution scatter: GQA 中 KV vectors 有 cluster 结构, MLA 中近似均匀球面\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验 SUSPENDED 是 median 档最大的叙事缺口。没有真 MLA 模型的实验数据, \n      Claim 2 (mechanistic explanation) 只能基于间接证据 (Qwen2 vs Llama per-layer r 对比) \n      给出 suggestive 论证。论文中应将 Section 5 从 \"Why Does MLA Break the Signal?\" \n      改为 \"Architectural Factors Modulating Signal Strength\", 用 per-layer + per-head \n      分析代替 MLA-specific 机制分析。如果实验恢复 (找到可测 MLA 模型), \n      median 档预期定性结论正确但定量 clean comparison 困难。\n\n  - name: \"Wall-clock: O(1) vs O(n) eviction cost\"\n    plan_id: kv-eviction-wallclock\n    description: >\n      测量 CARC-KV O(1) vs H2O O(n) 的 per-step eviction 耗时, \n      序列长度 L={4K, 8K, 16K, 32K}。\n    expected_results:\n      carc_4k_ms: 0.08\n      carc_8k_ms: 0.09\n      carc_16k_ms: 0.09\n      carc_32k_ms: 0.10\n      h2o_4k_ms: 0.25\n      h2o_8k_ms: 0.55\n      h2o_16k_ms: 1.20\n      h2o_32k_ms: 2.60\n      speedup_4k: 3.1x\n      speedup_8k: 6.1x\n      speedup_16k: 13.3x\n      speedup_32k: 26.0x\n      eviction_as_fraction_of_step_32k_carc: 0.3%\n      eviction_as_fraction_of_step_32k_h2o: 7.8%\n    result_rationale: >\n      CARC-KV 每步只做一次 EMA update + 一次 cosine similarity 比较, 计算量与序列长度无关 \n      (O(1)), 实测耗时 ~0.08-0.10ms 随 L 变化极小 (内存访问模式微变)。\n      H2O 需要累积所有 token 的 attention score 再选 top-k eviction candidate, \n      计算量 O(n) 随序列线性增长。在 32K 序列下, H2O eviction 占整个 decoding step 的 7.8%, \n      而 CARC-KV 仅 0.3%——在长序列推理 (如 AIME 思维链平均 15K+ tokens) 场景下, \n      这是有意义的实际加速。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Eviction Latency Comparison\"\n        columns: [Seq_Length, CARC-KV(ms), H2O(ms), Speedup]\n        rows:\n          - [4K, 0.08, 0.25, 3.1x]\n          - [8K, 0.09, 0.55, 6.1x]\n          - [16K, 0.09, 1.20, 13.3x]\n          - [32K, 0.10, 2.60, 26.0x]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-log plot: x 轴序列长度, y 轴 eviction latency, CARC-KV 水平线 vs H2O 斜率 ~1 的上升线\"\n    analysis: >\n      Wall-clock 结果是 O(1) KV eviction 作为 standalone contribution 的关键支撑。\n      在 16K+ 序列下 speedup >13x, 结合 kv-bench-001 中 70% budget 下 quality parity, \n      构成有说服力的 efficiency-quality trade-off。\n      注意事项: 这里测量的是纯 eviction overhead, 不是 end-to-end throughput——\n      需要在论文中明确说明, 因为 eviction 只占 decoding step 的一小部分。\n\n  - name: \"Per-head KV contribution analysis\"\n    plan_id: neg-per-head\n    description: >\n      分析 per-head cross-axis signal 贡献, 对 Llama (8 KV heads) 和 \n      DeepSeek-Distill-Qwen (4 KV heads) 进行 head-level r 分解, \n      检验是否仅是 head count 差异导致信号差距。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_per_head_r_mean: 0.40\n      llama_per_head_r_range: [0.28, 0.52]\n      llama_best_head_r: 0.52\n      llama_worst_head_r: 0.28\n      deepseek_per_head_r_mean: 0.11\n      deepseek_per_head_r_range: [0.04, 0.19]\n      deepseek_best_head_r: 0.19\n      deepseek_worst_head_r: 0.04\n      ratio_per_head: 3.6x  # 0.40/0.11\n      ratio_aggregate: 3.1x  # 0.47/0.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      即使在 per-head 基础上, Llama 的每个 KV head 的 signal 仍显著强于 DeepSeek-Qwen 的 \n      每个 KV head (mean r: 0.40 vs 0.11, 3.6x 差距)。这排除了 \"Llama 只是因为有更多 head \n      所以 aggregate signal 更强\" 的替代假设。Per-head ratio (3.6x) 甚至略大于 aggregate \n      ratio (3.1x), 说明 Llama 的 head aggregation 实际上引入了少量 inter-head noise。\n      Llama 内部 head 间 r 的方差 ([0.28, 0.52]) 暗示不同 head 捕捉不同类型的 redundancy \n      信号——head 5-6 (r~0.50) 可能专注于 positional/syntactic redundancy, \n      而 head 1-2 (r~0.30) 捕捉更高层的 semantic pattern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Head r Comparison\"\n        columns: [Model, Heads, Per-Head_r_mean, Per-Head_r_range, Aggregate_r]\n        rows:\n          - [Llama-3.1-8B, 8, 0.40, \"[0.28, 0.52]\", 0.47]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen, 4, 0.11, \"[0.04, 0.19]\", 0.15]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head r bar chart: 8 Llama heads + 4 DeepSeek heads 并排, 按 r 降序排列, 虚线标注 per-head mean\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-head 分析有效排除了 head-count confound, 但也引出了新问题: \n      为什么 Qwen2 架构的 per-head signal 这么弱? 可能原因包括:\n      (1) head dimension 差异 (Qwen2: 128, Llama: 128 — 实际相同, 排除);\n      (2) group ratio 差异 (Qwen2: 28Q/4KV=7:1, Llama: 32Q/8KV=4:1 — 更高的 group ratio \n      意味着每个 KV head 需要服务更多 query heads, 可能被迫学习更 general 的表示, \n      降低了与 specific MLP activation pattern 的耦合);\n      (3) 训练数据/目标差异。\n      Group ratio 假设 (4:1 vs 7:1) 是最有解释力的, 但需要更多模型验证。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: Extensions\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"KV eviction: key-only vs key+value anchor\"\n    plan_id: kv-eviction-ablation\n    description: >\n      消融实验: EMA anchor 分别基于 key-only, value-only, key+value concat。\n      在 50% KV budget 下比较 perplexity。\n    expected_results:\n      ppl_key_only: 6.2\n      ppl_value_only: 6.8\n      ppl_key_value_concat: 6.4\n      ppl_key_value_default: 6.4\n      ppl_full_kv: 5.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Key-only anchor 略优于 key+value concat (6.2 vs 6.4): key vectors 编码了 attention \n      routing 信息 (哪些 token 会被 attend to), 这与 token importance for eviction 直接相关。\n      Value vectors 携带 content 信息, 其 similarity 与 \"是否可安全 evict\" 的相关性较弱, \n      concat 后反而引入噪声。Value-only 最差 (6.8) 因为 value similarity 不反映 attention \n      pattern。差异幅度不大 (Δppl=0.2), 说明 key 和 value 都携带部分 redundancy 信息, \n      但 key 更 informative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Anchor Variant Ablation\"\n        columns: [Anchor_Type, ppl_50%_budget, Δppl_vs_full]\n        rows:\n          - [Key-only, 6.2, +1.0]\n          - [Key+Value (default), 6.4, +1.2]\n          - [Value-only, 6.8, +1.6]\n          - [Full KV (no eviction), 5.2, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 三种 anchor variant 的 ppl 对比, 误差棒表示跨 problem 方差\"\n    analysis: >\n      消融结果支持将 default 从 key+value 改为 key-only, 但增益有限 (0.2 ppl)。\n      论文中作为 supplementary ablation 呈现即可, 不需要在 main text 占过多篇幅。\n      如果选择 key-only 作为 final 方法, 需要重新跑 kv-bench-001 中的比较——\n      但时间可能不允许, 建议在 footnote 中提及 key-only variant exists and is marginally better。\n\n  - name: \"Llama two-tier sparsity downstream accuracy\"\n    plan_id: llama-downstream\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上应用 CARC two-tier MLP sparsity (redundant tokens 55%, novel tokens 40%), \n      与 uniform sparsity 在 MATH 数据集上比较准确率。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy_no_sparsity: 78.5%\n      accuracy_uniform_55pct: 72.0%\n      accuracy_uniform_47pct: 74.5%  # matched average sparsity\n      accuracy_two_tier_55_40: 75.5%\n      gain_over_uniform_55: +3.5%\n      gain_over_matched_avg: +1.0%\n      avg_effective_sparsity: 47.2%\n      fraction_tokens_redundant: 0.52\n    result_rationale: >\n      Two-tier sparsity 将 redundant tokens (52% of tokens, 由 KV sim > threshold 判定) \n      剪枝 55%, novel tokens 剪枝 40%, 平均有效 sparsity ~47.2%。\n      相比 uniform 55% (+3.5%) 的增益来自避免对 novel tokens 的过度剪枝——\n      这些 token 承载关键推理步骤, 55% sparsity 导致不可恢复的信息损失。\n      相比 matched-average uniform 47% (+1.0%) 的增益更有意义但幅度有限——\n      说明 adaptive allocation 确有价值但 cross-axis signal 的 Δpert=+6.6% \n      在 end-to-end accuracy 上被衰减了: 不是每个 Δpert gain 都直接转化为准确率, \n      因为 (a) 只有部分 tokens 被差异化处理, (b) 部分 MLP neurons 的激活对最终输出 \n      影响有限。+1.0% 的 gain 需要诚实评估是否 justify cross-axis 的额外系统复杂度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Downstream Accuracy Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, MLP_Sparsity, MATH_Accuracy, Δ_vs_no_sparsity]\n        rows:\n          - [No sparsity, 0%, 78.5%, \"—\"]\n          - [Uniform, 55%, 72.0%, -6.5%]\n          - [Uniform (matched avg), 47%, 74.5%, -4.0%]\n          - [Two-tier (CARC), \"55%/40%\", 75.5%, -3.0%]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 四种条件下 MATH 准确率, 标注 sparsity 节省和 accuracy trade-off\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 cross-axis story 的 practical significance 试金石。+1.0% over matched-average \n      是正面结果但不够强——reviewer 可能说 \"marginal gain doesn't justify the complexity \n      of maintaining cross-axis coordination.\" 论文中应框架为:\n      (1) 证明 cross-axis signal 可转化为下游增益 (方向正确);\n      (2) 承认当前增益幅度有限, 可能因 signal strength (r=0.47) 仍有提升空间;\n      (3) 将此与 O(1) KV eviction standalone value 互补——即使 cross-axis 增益有限, \n      KV eviction 本身仍有独立价值。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9dfacb55-cee2-410c-8532-251c7d291126","total_cost_usd":0.57660475,"usage":{"inp